        <body>
            <div xml:id="d283">

                <pb facs="0447" n="359" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv02/pg359"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conf. 772.73/4</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Embassy in France to the Commission to Negotiate
                        Peace </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1919-01-04">January 4,
                            1919</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The American Embassy at Paris presents its compliments to the American Commission
                    to Negotiate Peace and has the honor to enclose herewith for its information,
                    copy and translation of a letter from the Minister for Foreign Affairs a. i. of
                    Montenegro transmitting translation of a note received by him from the Servian
                    Chargé d’Affaires near the Montenegrin Government, in which the latter states
                    that his functions have come to an end from the date of December 4th on which
                    date, he writes, the union between Montenegro and Servia became effective.</p>



                <xi:include href="d283-a1.xml" xpointer="d283-a1"/>
